sentences to turn on.

624
00:29:12,150 --> 00:29:14,340
And this is the
opposite setting,

625
00:29:14,340 --> 00:29:18,720
where you don't really care
about the model's emergence.

626
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:21,030
You can just train a very
small model on the data,

627
00:29:21,030 --> 00:29:25,840
and do all of the task without
having to use a lot of compute.

628
00:29:25,840 --> 00:29:29,020
And the final point
is that, I think,

629
00:29:29,020 --> 00:29:30,670
a really promising
research direction,

630
00:29:30,670 --> 00:29:32,590
if anyone is interested
in doing research,

631
00:29:32,590 --> 00:29:36,797
is to work on predicting
future emergent abilities.

632
00:29:36,797 --> 00:29:38,380
And I haven't seen
a lot of work on it

633
00:29:38,380 --> 00:29:41,290
