think, maybe it's too hard,

634
00:29:41,290 --> 00:29:42,190
for example.

635
00:29:42,190 --> 00:29:46,360
You can only predict
emergence for a specific task.

636
00:29:46,360 --> 00:29:48,430
Or one way of
predicting emergence

637
00:29:48,430 --> 00:29:50,720
might not be super
general, and--

638
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:52,220
so I haven't seen
much work on that,

639
00:29:52,220 --> 00:29:55,160
but I think this is a pretty
promising direction to work on.

640
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:57,368
And maybe [INAUDIBLE] is
working on it, I don't know.

