1406
01:03:41,330 --> 01:03:45,290
So basically, what
people usually do is,

1407
01:03:45,290 --> 01:03:47,840
they'll just generate
one chain of thought,

1408
01:03:47,840 --> 01:03:49,820
and then they'll take
the final answer.

